WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
- I heard that you,

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.500
is it mixed martial arts you
were really into as well?

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.118
- [Sydney] Yeah, MMA! I was fighting.

00:00:04.118 --> 00:00:05.760
- You are a very physical person.

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:06.960
Yeah, I like this, it's awesome.

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:08.470
- My mom and my dad would tell me

00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:10.950
to try and fall in love with
as many things as possible.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:11.920
- [Kelly] That's so good!

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:12.753
- So, I would.

00:00:12.753 --> 00:00:14.780
- Yeah, how into like MMA did you get?

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.054
- [Sydney] Like very into it.

00:00:16.054 --> 00:00:19.470
I trained with Ronda Rousey's senseies

00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:21.270
I did competitions.

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:23.580
I got first place fighting all guys.

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:24.490
- [Kelly] What?

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:25.323
- [Sydney] Yeah.

00:00:25.323 --> 00:00:26.397
- [Kelly] You're a bad-ass.

00:00:26.397 --> 00:00:27.370
- [Sydney] Thank you!

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:29.130
- You're like this little petite killer.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:32.201
Yeah, wait. Did you,
you get hurt doing that?

00:00:32.201 --> 00:00:33.540
- Yes.

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:34.660
- Do they frown upon that

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:35.493
with you being an actor

00:00:35.493 --> 00:00:36.995
and needing your face to not be bruised?

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:40.070
- Unfortunately, you sign
a little piece of paper

00:00:40.070 --> 00:00:42.005
that says you're not to do X, Y, and Z.

00:00:42.005 --> 00:00:44.080
And I am all of X, Y, and Z.

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.220
- Yeah. I have to do that too.

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:46.522
If you're on a show, yeah.

00:00:46.522 --> 00:00:47.380
(stammering)

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:49.210
Luckily, yeah that's why I don't do MMA

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:50.121
it's cause I decided.

00:00:50.121 --> 00:00:50.954
- [Sydney] Yeah.

00:00:50.954 --> 00:00:51.787
- Yeah, I was like,

00:00:51.787 --> 00:00:54.590
fine, I'll put it on the
back burner for ya'll.

00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:56.100
It sounds like your parents
were awesome, though.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:57.010
That's really good advice

00:00:57.010 --> 00:00:58.510
to like really get you
involved in everything.

00:00:58.510 --> 00:00:59.930
I try and do that with my kids

00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:01.890
just because I, I was
involved a lot as a kid

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:03.880
and I felt like one, it
keeps you out of trouble

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:05.700
and two, you start to figure out things

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:07.210
you really like or really get into.

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:08.730
- [Sydney] Yeah. And you
learn more about yourself.

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:10.060
I mean, I grew up in a smaller town,

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:12.600
so sometimes you can get lost

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:15.180
and it's good to stay
focused on something.

00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:17.157
- Absolutely. I love a small town.

00:01:17.157 --> 00:01:19.140
So your, your new movie is called.

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:20.400
I want to say this so right.

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:22.070
But it's The Voyeurs?

00:01:22.070 --> 00:01:22.903
- The Voyeurs.

00:01:22.903 --> 00:01:23.736
- The Voyeurs!

00:01:23.736 --> 00:01:24.830
See, I feel like if I say the voyeurs,

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:26.310
it sounds like I'm Texan

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:27.856
and people are gonna make
fun of me and be like,

00:01:27.856 --> 00:01:29.412
oh, she said voyeurs.

00:01:29.412 --> 00:01:30.245
- (in a strange accent) The Voyeurs.

00:01:30.245 --> 00:01:33.110
- [Kelly] Yeah. So I was
trying to say, voy-yale.

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:35.170
- [Sydney] It does, I mean
we did film in Montreal,

00:01:35.170 --> 00:01:37.507
which is like French Canadian.

00:01:37.507 --> 00:01:39.410
- I lived Montreal, by the way.

00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:40.243
- [Sydney] It's beautiful.

00:01:40.243 --> 00:01:41.076
- Yeah.

00:01:41.076 --> 00:01:41.909
- [Sydney] I had such a cultural shock

00:01:41.909 --> 00:01:44.360
when I got there, cause I was
like, oh, I'm going to Canada.

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:46.270
I'm going to bring all my jean jackets.

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:48.270
And then all of a sudden like,
oh my God, I'm in France?

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:49.103
What am I doing?

00:01:49.103 --> 00:01:50.090
- [Kelly] Go to British Columbia, too.

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:51.500
That's amazing. Vancouver all over there.

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:54.250
But so what, what is it
about what's the movie about?

00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:57.370
- So, well, I can't give all of it away.

00:01:57.370 --> 00:01:59.580
So me and

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:00.830
- [Kelly] You kinda seem like perverts

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:02.390
watching people in another place.

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:03.223
- [Sydney] We are.

00:02:03.223 --> 00:02:04.780
Unfortunately, I become really obsessed

00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:06.840
with this couple across the way.

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:08.640
And I start stalking them.

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:09.473
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh.

00:02:09.473 --> 00:02:11.120
- And it just turns out really bad.

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:13.350
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh. I
love, is it a kind of fun

00:02:13.350 --> 00:02:15.090
to play a crazy person?

00:02:15.090 --> 00:02:16.220
- [Sydney] I feel like we're all crazy.

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:18.270
- Well, that's true. Solid point. Touche.

